# bar_lure (task CE; docs/reference/PLAYTEST.md 1). The ksim_aggro_drop setup as a file: the player outside the Hub's Bar blackmarket,
# a Dust Bandit patrol on the open ground past the door. Attack a bandit, run in through the door and up (or kite in and out), and see
# whether the patrol follows you in, whether the crew joins, and whether the aggro comes off when you break contact.
# Only the player is ever ordered (the scenario places the world; SCENARIO_IMPORT.md "Rule").
KSCEN 2
